// Copy this file to `Debug.local.xcconfig` and paste your real X (Twitter) OAuth public Client ID.
// The actual file is gitignored. The Client ID is the public half of your X app at
// https://developer.x.com/en/portal/dashboard → your RareImagery app → Keys and tokens →
// OAuth 2.0 Client ID. (NOT the Client Secret — that stays server-side.)
//
// Make sure rareimagery://auth/callback is registered as a Callback URL in the X app settings.

X_CLIENT_ID = paste_your_x_oauth_client_id_here
